            <abstract>
                <p>This general record should encompass Amharic texts containing Orthodox Church teachings in the form of a catechism.  
                    The catechism may take the form of questions and answers, but it may also be a plain text explaining the tenets of the faith.
                    The prototypical works of this kind are <ref type="title" corresp="LIT1097Ammest">Five Pillars of Mystery</ref> and <ref type="title" corresp="LIT1584Hayman">The Orthodox Faith</ref>. 
                    This record is intended for texts similar to these, but which cannot be identified with them. 
                   </p>
            </abstract>
